Subject: Which Fitting Function to Pick?
Message-ID: <M78elEyxAM4.piWDVtgHFFoJ@unmarked.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/unmarked/c/M78elEyxAM4/m/piWDVtgHFFoJ>
